:: Lost Lamb Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'lost-lamb-entry'>>
  <<if $LostLamb.endings.includes('main')>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if Time.hour gte 7 and Time.hour lt 18>>
          A pale sliver of daylight filters through the parted curtains, resting on the floorboards. On the third stair outside, the board no longer creaks with that hollow dread. In the hand-width gap between two thick encyclopedias on the shelf, an old, carefully folded paper tower stands upright, undisturbed across the years.
        <<else>>
          The steady hum of the computer fan keeps the shadows at bay. In the hand-width gap between two heavy books on the shelf, the faded paper tower from long ago remains quietly in place.
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if Time.hour gte 7 and Time.hour lt 18>>
          厚重的窗帘拉开了一线，一缕白昼的微光斜斜落在地板上。门外第三级台阶不再发出那种空洞惊悸的吱呀声。书架上两本厚百科全书之间、那道手掌宽的缝隙里，静静立着一座多年前折好的褪色纸塔，穿过漫长岁月依然完好。
        <<else>>
          电脑风扇平稳的低鸣驱散了走廊里的阴翳。书架上两本厚书之间的缝隙中，那座多年前折好的褪色小纸塔依旧安静地立在那里。
        <</if>>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $LostLamb.talk and Time.hour gte 18 and maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.kylarHere>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if $LostLamb.talk is 'company'>>
          <<if $LostLamb.talkVow is 'offered'>>Kylar looks towards the door as you enter. "Nobody's taking you away," <<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>> says, gripping the back of the chair. "I'll wait for you at home."<br><<elseif $LostLamb.talkVow is 'refused'>>Kylar pauses the game when you come in. "You came back." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> glances past you before putting the controller down.<br><</if>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>Kylar turns the computer chair a little, keeping both you and the doorway in view.<<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>Kylar glances at the place where you sat and moves a pillow aside.<<else>>Kylar leaves the sound from the computer low. There is room beside the pillows if you want to sit again.<</if>>
        <<elseif $LostLamb.talk is 'night'>>
          <<if $LostLamb.talkVow is 'sealed'>>Kylar watches your mouth before looking at your face. "Don't say what that person said." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> turns the computer's sound up.<br><<elseif $LostLamb.talkVow is 'broken'>>Kylar lowers the sound when you enter. "You can tell me if it happens again." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> keeps <<nnpc_his 'Kylar'>> eyes on the screen.<br><</if>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>Kylar looks up as you pass the bed, then back at the door. <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> does not ask you to describe the dream again.<<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>Kylar's eyes follow you past the bed. "You slept alright?" <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> waits for your answer before returning to the screen.<<else>>Kylar glances towards the bed. <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> opens <<nnpc_his 'Kylar'>> mouth, then turns back to the game without asking.<</if>>
        <<else>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>Kylar watches you enter. <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> starts to turn the chair, stops, and leaves the space by the bed clear.<<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>Kylar looks up. "Want company this time?" <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> stays by the computer while you decide.<<else>>Kylar gives you a brief nod and remains at the computer, leaving you to choose where to sit.<</if>>
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if $LostLamb.talk is 'company'>>
          <<if $LostLamb.talkVow is 'offered'>>你进来时，凯拉尔望了望门。“谁也别想把你带走。”<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>说着，抓紧了椅背。“我在家等你。”<br><<elseif $LostLamb.talkVow is 'refused'>>你进来时，凯拉尔暂停了游戏。“你回来了。”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>朝你身后看了一眼，才放下手柄。<br><</if>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>凯拉尔稍稍转动电脑椅，让你和门口都留在视线里。<<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>凯拉尔看了一眼你先前坐过的地方，把一只枕头挪到旁边。<<else>>凯拉尔没有调高电脑的音量。如果你还想坐一会儿，枕头旁边有空位。<</if>>
        <<elseif $LostLamb.talk is 'night'>>
          <<if $LostLamb.talkVow is 'sealed'>>凯拉尔先看你的嘴唇，才看向你的脸。“别再说那个人的话。”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>调高了电脑音量。<br><<elseif $LostLamb.talkVow is 'broken'>>你进来时，凯拉尔调低了音量。“再梦到的话，可以告诉我。”<<nnpc_His 'Kylar'>>眼睛仍盯着屏幕。<br><</if>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>你经过床边时，凯拉尔抬头看你，又看向房门。<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>没有让你再讲一次那个梦。<<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>你经过床边时，凯拉尔的目光跟着你。“你睡得还好吗？”听到你的回答后，<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>才重新看向屏幕。<<else>>凯拉尔瞥向床边，张了张嘴，最后什么也没问，转回去继续游戏。<</if>>
        <<else>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>凯拉尔看着你进来。<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>刚要转动椅子，又停住了，床边的空位没有被占去。<<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>凯拉尔抬起头。“这次想让我陪着吗？”你还在考虑，<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>便留在电脑旁等着。<<else>>凯拉尔对你轻轻点头，仍坐在电脑前，让你自己挑个地方坐下。<</if>>
        <</if>>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.talkReady>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Talk to Kylar about the dream', '和凯拉尔谈谈那个梦'] 'Lost Lamb Talk'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.available>>
    <<bedicon 'kylar'>><<lanLink ['Lie down for a while', '躺下休息一会儿'] 'Lost Lamb Recall'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'lost-lamb-followup-check'>>
  <<set _lambFollowupReady to Boolean(maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.reward)
    and !$combat and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced
    and $stress lt $stressmax and !isPregnancyEnding()>>
  <<if !_lambFollowupReady>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<switch _args[0]>>
    <<case 'Sydney'>>
      <<sydneySchedule>>
      <<set _lambFollowupReady to _lambFollowupReady and !$LostLamb.sydneyTalk
        and C.npc.Sydney.init is 1 and C.npc.Sydney.state is 'active'
        and ($location is 'school' and $bus is 'schoollibrary' and _sydney_location is 'library'
          or $location is 'adult_shop' and _sydney_location is 'shop'
          or $location is 'temple' and _sydney_location is 'temple' and $sydney_templeWork is 'pray')>>
    <<case 'Gwylan'>>
      <<set _lambFollowupReady to _lambFollowupReady and !$LostLamb.gwylanTalk
        and C.npc.Gwylan.init is 1 and C.npc.Gwylan.state is 'active'
        and $location is 'forest_shop' and gwylanSchedule() is 'shop'>>
    <<case 'bishop'>>
      <<set _lambFollowupReady to _lambFollowupReady and !$LostLamb.bishopTalk
        and $kylar_manor_secret gte 3 and Boolean($per_npc?.bishop) and $location is 'temple'
        and ['Temple Confessor Intro Ask', 'Revelation Temple Bishop', 'Revelation Temple Monstrance'].includes($passage)>>
    <<default>><<set _lambFollowupReady to false>>
  <</switch>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'lost-lamb-followup-link'>>
  <<lost-lamb-followup-check _args[0]>>
  <<if !_lambFollowupReady>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<set _lambName to _args[0], _lambMinutes to _args[2], _lambTarget to _args[3], _lambUsed to false>>
  <<capture _lambName _lambMinutes _lambTarget _lambUsed>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>>
    <<lanLink _args[1]>>
      <<lost-lamb-followup-check _lambName>>
      <<if _lambFollowupReady and !_lambUsed>>
        <<set _lambUsed to true, _lambSource to $passage>>
        <<pass _lambMinutes>>
        <<lost-lamb-followup-check _lambName>>
        <<if _lambFollowupReady and $passage is _lambSource>>
          <!-- 在入场链接登记并结算；正文重绘、读档和旧链接均不再重复发放。 -->
          <<switch _lambName>>
            <<case 'Sydney'>>
              <<set $LostLamb.sydneyTalk to true>>
              <<set $LostLamb_sydneyReturn to ({school: 'School Library', adult_shop: 'Adult Shop', temple: 'Temple Sydney'})[$location]>>
              <<npcincr Sydney love 2>><<stress -5>>
            <<case 'Gwylan'>>
              <<set $LostLamb.gwylanTalk to true>>
              <<run $gwylanSeen ??= []>><<run $gwylanSeen.pushUnique('kylar_parents')>>
              <<stress -10>><<trauma -5>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>>
            <<case 'bishop'>>
              <<set $LostLamb.bishopTalk to true>>
              <<set $LostLamb_bishopReturn to _lambSource is 'Revelation Temple Bishop' ? 'Revelation Temple Office' : _lambSource>>
              <<awareness 5>><<stress 5>>
          <</switch>>
          <<goto _lambTarget>>
        <<elseif $passage is _lambSource>>
          <<goto `$nextPassageCheck || $nextPassage || _lambSource`>>
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</capture>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'lost-lamb-sydney-link'>>
  <<lost-lamb-followup-link 'Sydney' `['Tap the secret rhythm (0:05)', '轻叩桌上的暗号 (0:05)']` 5 'Lost Lamb Sydney Talk'>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'lost-lamb-gwylan-link'>>
  <<lost-lamb-followup-link 'Gwylan' `['Ask Gwylan about the past (0:10)', '向格威岚打听旧事 (0:10)']` 10 'Lost Lamb Gwylan Talk'>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'lost-lamb-bishop-link'>>
  <<lost-lamb-followup-link 'bishop' `['Ask about the sealed manor (0:10)', '询问封死的宅邸 (0:10)']` 10 'Lost Lamb Bishop Talk'>>
<</widget>>

:: Lost Lamb Recall
<<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.available>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('promised')>>You kept the unfinished drawing safe, the way you said you would. You rest a hand on one of Kylar's pillows. You remember the dust in the attic, the light coming on, the spikes of silver and bronze surrounding an empty centre.<<else>>You rest a hand on one of Kylar's pillows. You remember the dust in the attic, the light coming on, the spikes of silver and bronze surrounding an empty centre.<</if>> The upper edge looked as though part of it had been hacked away. Kylar had not known it was there. "I didn't think my parents were religious."
      <br><br>
      When you asked about the change, <<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>> could only describe the night around it. <<nnpc_His 'Kylar'>> parents were excited. They put <<nnpc_him 'Kylar'>> to bed early. Windows broke below. <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> hid under the covers. By morning, they were different.
      <br><br>
      <<if $sydneySeen.includes('Kylar manor')>>Sydney used to visit this house. Their parents knew one another. Then Sydney was told not to come again. You try to recall whether <<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>> ever said why.<br><br><</if>>
      <<if $kylar_manor_secret gte 3>>The bishop said Kylar's parents had unknowingly befriended servants of Auriga. He spoke of an altar and a blood moon. They begged for their child to be spared. You remember how easily he admitted what he had done.<br><br><</if>>
      You lie down. A door closes somewhere in the house. Before the footsteps fade, you almost hear someone calling a child downstairs for supper.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('promised')>>你说过会留着那幅没画完的画，你确实留住了。你将手放在凯拉尔的一只枕头上。你记起阁楼的灰尘、亮起的灯，以及围着空心排列的银与青铜尖角。<<else>>你将手放在凯拉尔的一只枕头上。你记起阁楼的灰尘、亮起的灯，以及围着空心排列的银与青铜尖角。<</if>>上缘扭曲着，像是被砍掉过一部分。凯拉尔之前并不知道它在那里。“我不认为我的父母信教。”
      <br><br>
      问起异变时，<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>只能说出围绕它的那个夜晚。父母很兴奋，让<<nnpc_him 'Kylar'>>早点上床。楼下的窗户碎了。<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>藏在被子下面。到了早晨，他们就变得不一样了。
      <br><br>
      <<if $sydneySeen.includes('Kylar manor')>>悉尼以前会来这所房子玩，两家的父母互相认识。后来，悉尼被告知不能再来。你努力回想，<<nnpc_he 'Sydney'>>有没有说过原因。<br><br><</if>>
      <<if $kylar_manor_secret gte 3>>主教说过，凯拉尔的父母不知情地结交了奥里加的仆从。他提到染血的祭坛与血色的红月，提到他们哀求放过自己的孩子。你仍记得，他承认这些时语气有多轻描淡写。<br><br><</if>>
      你躺下。房子里有扇门关上。脚步声还没消失，你几乎听见有人喊一个孩子下楼吃晚饭。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <i class='teal'><<language>><<option 'EN'>>You will follow the dream as Kylar. Your present time and belongings will return when you wake.<<option 'CN'>>你将在梦里作为凯拉尔行动。醒来后，会恢复现实的时间与随身物品。<</language>></i><br><br>
  <<bedicon 'kylar'>><<lanLink ['Close your eyes (0:30)', '闭上眼睛 (0:30)'] 'Lost Lamb Memory'>><<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.available>><<pass 30>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').begin()>><</if>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Sit up', '坐起来'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Lost Lamb Memory
<<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.active>>
  <<switch maplebirch.get('LostLamb').scene.part>>
    <<case 'before'>><<lost-lamb-before>>
    <<case 'stay'>><<lost-lamb-stay>>
    <<case 'verdict'>><<lost-lamb-verdict>>
    <<case 'main'>><<lost-lamb-main>>
  <</switch>>
  <br><br>
  <<for _choice range maplebirch.get('LostLamb').choices>>
    <<capture _choice>>
      <<if _choice.icon>><<icon _choice.icon>><</if>>
      <<lanLink _choice.text 'Lost Lamb Memory'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').choose(_choice.id)>><</lanLink>><<= maplebirch.get('LostLamb').hint(_choice)>><br>
    <</capture>>
  <</for>>
  <<if $LostLamb.ending>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Open your eyes', '睁开眼睛'] 'Lost Lamb Wake'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Wake for now', '暂时醒来'] 'Lost Lamb Wake'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Open your eyes', '睁开眼睛'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: Lost Lamb Wake
<<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.reward and $LostLamb.ending is 'main'>>
  <<earnFeat 'Lost Lamb'>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You are in Kylar's room. The monitors light the wall. The pillow is warm beneath your cheek.
    <br><br>
    <<if $LostLamb.ending is 'main'>>
      <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('main-vow-offered')>>
        Your lips are moving before you sit up. You stop just short of saying your name. Beside you, a pillow has kept its hollow. You reach to smooth it, then pull your hand back. You cannot remember whether the silence began before or after you said yes.
      <<else>>
        You wake with your mouth open, still calling to the window. Voices come from the computer. You lower your feet to the floor. Farther along the hall, wood scrapes against wood. You pull your feet back beneath the blanket.
      <</if>>
    <<elseif $LostLamb.ending is 'stay'>>
      <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('stay-vow-bound')>>
        You reach for a latch that is not there. The name you put into the lock waits behind your teeth. Sydney. You look towards the door before looking at Kylar. For a moment, you want to see it bolted.
      <<else>>
        Your fingers close on the blanket as though it were the torn paper. There is no tower in your hand. A little click comes from the computer, then another. You wait through the pause before the third, with both hands held still.
      <</if>>
    <<elseif $LostLamb.ending is 'verdict'>>
      <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('verdict-vow-sealed')>>
        The words are already formed: nobody outside needs to know. You swallow them. Someone shifts in the corridor, and you press your lips together until the sound has passed. The child who called upstairs never received your answer.
      <<else>>
        You catch yourself taking breath to shout upstairs. The shelves and monitors come back into focus. You cannot put a face to the visitor, but you can still hear the cup being set down before the order to be quiet.
      <</if>>
    <<else>>
      You rub the place where the doorframe pressed against your palm. There is no mark. When a floorboard creaks outside, you wait until the footsteps pass.
    <</if>>
    <<if $LostLamb.ending is 'main' and $LostLamb.known.auriga>>
      <br><br>
      You remember the bishop describing locks being gnawed away, and holes that his order filled. In the dream, both voices wanted your hand on the bolt. One promised safety. The other promised that nobody would leave. You remember the two promises more clearly than either face.
    <</if>>
    <<if $LostLamb.ending is 'main' and $LostLamb.known.gwylan>>
      <br><br>
      Gwylan had seen Kylar's parents hunting small animals in the forest. <<nnpc_He 'Gwylan'>> had looked surprised when you said their child still lived here. You look towards the hall again. Kylar has been passing that room for years.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if Time.hour gte 18 and maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.kylarHere>>
      Kylar turns from the computer.
      <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>
        "Wh-who were you calling?" <<nnpc_His 'Kylar'>> gaze moves to the doorway, then back to your mouth. You say you had a dream. "Nobody came in," <<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>> says. <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> pulls the chair around until the door is behind <<nnpc_him 'Kylar'>>.
      <<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>
        "You were talking." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> comes to the bedside and catches the blanket when you try to put it aside. "Are you going?" You say you have only just woken. <<nnpc_His 'Kylar'>> fingers stay in the fabric. "Oh. Then... stay a little longer."
      <<else>>
        "A nightmare?" <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> lowers the computer's sound. You nod. Kylar looks at the pillows, then at the gap beneath the bed. "You can sit here." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> pushes the chair nearer, keeping a space for you between the bed and the computer.
      <</if>>
    <<elseif Time.hour lte 6 and C.npc.Kylar.state is 'active'>>
      Kylar shifts beneath the sheets. You stop moving until <<nnpc_his 'Kylar'>> breathing settles. You cannot tell whether <<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>> heard you.
    <<else>>
      No one answers from the chair. You sit up and listen to the house before standing.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你在凯拉尔房间。显示器照着墙壁，枕头贴在脸颊下，有一点暖。
    <br><br>
    <<if $LostLamb.ending is 'main'>>
      <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('main-vow-offered')>>
        还没坐起来，嘴唇已经动了。你赶在说出自己名字前停住。身旁的枕头留着凹陷，你伸手想抚平，又把手收回来。你记不清寂静是在答应之前，还是之后开始的。
      <<else>>
        醒来时，你的嘴仍张着，还在朝窗户喊。电脑里有人在说话。你把脚放到地上。走廊深处，木头刮过木头。你又把脚缩回被子下面。
      <</if>>
    <<elseif $LostLamb.ending is 'stay'>>
      <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('stay-vow-bound')>>
        你伸手去找并不存在的门闩。交给锁的名字还抵在牙齿后面。悉尼。你先看房门，才看凯拉尔。有那么一瞬间，你想看见它被闩上。
      <<else>>
        手指攥住被子，像是仍抓着撕破的纸。掌心没有纸塔。电脑轻轻响了一声，又是一声。你一动不动，等着第三下前的那段停顿。
      <</if>>
    <<elseif $LostLamb.ending is 'verdict'>>
      <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('verdict-vow-sealed')>>
        那句话已经到了嘴边：不必让外面的人知道。你咽了回去。走廊里有动静，你抿紧嘴唇，直到声音过去。楼上喊人的孩子一直没有得到你的回答。
      <<else>>
        你发现自己吸了一口气，正准备朝楼上喊。书架和显示器渐渐清楚。你仍想不起那位来客的脸，却听得见要你安静之前，杯子被放下的声音。
      <</if>>
    <<else>>
      你揉着被门框压过的手掌，没有留下印子。屋外地板响了，你一直等到脚步声过去。
    <</if>>
    <<if $LostLamb.ending is 'main' and $LostLamb.known.auriga>>
      <br><br>
      你记得主教说过，锁正在被啃开，他们的修会负责填补裂隙。梦里，两种声音都要你的手按住门闩。一种许诺安全，另一种许诺谁也不会走。你记得这两个许诺，却记不清任何一张脸。
    <</if>>
    <<if $LostLamb.ending is 'main' and $LostLamb.known.gwylan>>
      <br><br>
      格威岚见过凯拉尔的父母在森林里捕食小动物。听见他们的孩子仍住在这里时，<<nnpc_he 'Gwylan'>>露出了惊讶。你又望向走廊。凯拉尔已经从那个房间前经过了很多年。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if Time.hour gte 18 and maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.kylarHere>>
      凯拉尔从电脑前转过头。
      <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>
        “你、你刚才在喊谁？”<<nnpc_His 'Kylar'>>目光移向门口，又看回你的嘴唇。你说自己做了个梦。“没人进来。”<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>说着，转过椅子，让房门留在<<nnpc_him 'Kylar'>>身后。
      <<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>
        “你刚才在说话。”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>来到床边。你想掀开被子，<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>便抓住了它。“要走了吗？”你说自己才刚醒。<<nnpc_His 'Kylar'>>手指仍攥着布料。“哦。那……再待一会儿吧。”
      <<else>>
        “做噩梦了？”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>调低电脑的声音。你点头。凯拉尔看了看枕头，又瞥向床底。“你可以坐这里。”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>把椅子推近，在床与电脑之间给你留下位置。
      <</if>>
    <<elseif Time.hour lte 6 and C.npc.Kylar.state is 'active'>>
      凯拉尔在被子下动了一下。你停住，等<<nnpc_his 'Kylar'>>呼吸重新平稳。你不知道<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>有没有听见。
    <<else>>
      椅子那边没有人应答。你坐起来，听过屋里的动静才站起身。
    <</if>>
<</language>><br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.reward and $LostLamb.ending is 'main'>>
  <<language>><<option 'EN'>>You have gained the trait <span class='black'>Dream Scar</span>. <span class='green'>The ongoing stress caused by nightmares during sleep is reduced by 25%.</span><<option 'CN'>>你获得了特质<span class='black'>“梦痕”</span>。<span class='green'>睡眠中因噩梦持续增加的压力减少 25%。</span><</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Sit up', '坐起来'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Lost Lamb Talk
<<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.talkReady>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "I dreamed about the house," you say. Kylar's hand stops on the mouse.
      <br><br>
      <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>"What did you see?" <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> turns the chair to face you. "Did somebody tell you to look?"<<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>"Was I there?" <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> moves closer before you answer. "You can tell me. You aren't going yet, are you?"<<else>>"Oh." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> lowers the computer's sound, then glances at the hall. "About... what?"<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “我梦见了这所房子。”你说。凯拉尔的手停在鼠标上。
      <br><br>
      <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>“你看到了什么？”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>转过椅子，面对着你。“有人让你去看吗？”<<elseif maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>>“我在里面吗？”你还没回答，<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>便往这边靠近。“可以告诉我。你还不走，对吧？”<<else>>“哦。”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>调低电脑的声音，又瞥向走廊。“梦见……什么了？”<</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('main-vow-offered')>>
    <<couchicon>><<lanLink ['Promise that nobody will take you away (0:10)', '答应不会让别人带走你 (0:10)'] 'Lost Lamb Talk'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').talk('company')>><</lanLink>><<gglove 'Kylar'>><<lksuspicion>><<lstress>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<couchicon>><<lanLink ['Sit with Kylar for a while (0:10)', '陪凯拉尔坐一会儿 (0:10)'] 'Lost Lamb Talk'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').talk('company')>><</lanLink>><<glove 'Kylar'>><<lksuspicion>><<lstress>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('verdict-vow-sealed')>>
    <<bedicon 'kylar'>><<lanLink ["Repeat the visitor's assurance (0:10)", '重复来客的保证 (0:10)'] 'Lost Lamb Talk'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').talk('night')>><</lanLink>><<llove 'Kylar'>><<gksuspicion>><<gstress>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<bedicon 'kylar'>><<lanLink ['Ask about the night Kylar remembers (0:10)', '问起凯拉尔记得的那一夜 (0:10)'] 'Lost Lamb Talk'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').talk('night')>><</lanLink>><<glove 'Kylar'>><<lstress>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<relaxicon>><<lanLink ['Ask for a little space (0:05)', '想独自待一会儿 (0:05)'] 'Lost Lamb Talk'>><<run maplebirch.get('LostLamb').talk('space')>><</lanLink>><<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>><<gksuspicion>><</if>><<lstress>><br>
<<elseif $LostLamb.talk and maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.kylarHere>>
  <<switch $LostLamb.talk>>
    <<case 'company'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if $LostLamb.talkVow is 'offered'>>
            "Nobody is going to take me away," you say. Kylar stares, then comes to your side so quickly that the chair bumps the desk. "You mean it? Even if they ask?" <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> takes your hand, waiting for you to answer again. When you nod, <<nnpc_his 'Kylar'>> shoulders lower. "Then I'll keep them away." <<nnpc_His 'Kylar'>> grip tightens until you have to ask <<nnpc_him 'Kylar'>> to ease it.
          <<else>>
            You sit beside Kylar and ask <<nnpc_him 'Kylar'>> to show you the game on the computer. <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> starts explaining too quickly, stops, then tries again. <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>"Just a while?" <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> glances at the door. You repeat that you want to sit here now. <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> moves the chair closer.<<else>>"We could play together next time." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> looks at you instead of the screen while saying it.<</if>>
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          Kylar watches the game, occasionally glancing your way. When you shift on the mattress, <<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>> turns towards you. "You will come back?" You have not said anything about leaving.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if $LostLamb.talkVow is 'offered'>>
            “没人能把我带走。”你说。凯拉尔怔住，随即来到你身旁，快得让椅子撞上桌沿。“真的？就算他们来找你？”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>握住你的手，等你再回答一遍。你点头，<<nnpc_his 'Kylar'>>肩膀才放松。“那我会让他们离远点。”<<nnpc_His 'Kylar'>>手越握越紧，你不得不让<<nnpc_him 'Kylar'>>轻一点。
          <<else>>
            你在凯拉尔旁边坐下，请<<nnpc_him 'Kylar'>>讲讲电脑上的游戏。<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>说得太快，停了一下，又重新开始。<<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>“就一会儿？”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>瞥向房门。你重复说，现在想坐在这里。<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>将椅子挪近。<<else>>“下次可以一起玩。”说这句话时，<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>一直望着你，没有看屏幕。<</if>>
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          凯拉尔看着游戏，不时瞥你一眼。你在床垫上挪了一下，<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>便转过头。“你还会回来吧？”你还没说要走。
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'night'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if $LostLamb.talkVow is 'sealed'>>
            "In the dream, someone said your parents were safe as long as nobody told the people outside." Kylar stops moving. "Who?" You say you could not see the face. <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> asks again. "Wh-who told you that? They didn't want this." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> draws <<nnpc_his 'Kylar'>> hand back from the desk and looks towards the corridor. You try to explain that it was a dream. "Then don't say it like they wanted it." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> clicks the mouse hard. The game has not moved.
          <<else>>
            You ask about the windows breaking that night. Kylar pulls at a loose thread on the pillow. "I hid. I told you." You say you heard a child calling in the dream. "I don't remember calling." The thread snaps. <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> leaves it between two fingers. "I could have. I don't..." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> looks at you. "Did you stay with me?" You say you woke here. After a pause <<if isLoveInterest('Kylar') or maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>><<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>> leans against your shoulder, still watching the door.<<else>><<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>> pulls the chair nearer without looking away from the door.<</if>>
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          Something scrapes farther down the hall. Kylar turns the computer's volume up, drowning it out.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if $LostLamb.talkVow is 'sealed'>>
            “梦里有人说，只要不告诉外面的人，你父母就安全了。”凯拉尔停住了。“谁？”你说没有看清脸。<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>又问：“谁、谁告诉你这些的？他们不想变成这样。”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>把手从桌沿缩回来，望向走廊。你想解释那只是梦。“那就别说得像他们愿意一样。”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>重重按响鼠标，游戏却没有继续。
          <<else>>
            你问起那晚碎掉的窗户。凯拉尔拉着枕头上的一根松线。“我躲起来了。跟你说过。”你说梦里有个孩子在喊人。“我不记得喊过。”线断了，<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>仍捏在两根手指间。“可能喊了。我不……”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>望向你。“你陪着我吗？”你说自己醒来时就在这里。停了一会儿，<<if isLoveInterest('Kylar') or maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'close'>><<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>靠上你的肩膀，仍望着门口。<<else>><<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>把椅子挪近，没有移开看向门口的目光。<</if>>
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          走廊深处传来刮擦声。凯拉尔调高电脑的音量，盖住了它。
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'space'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You ask for a few minutes alone beside the bed.
          <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>"Who are you going to see?" Kylar gets up before you can answer. You point at the bed. "Here. I said here." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> stays between you and the door. Only when you sit does <<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>> step back to the chair. It remains facing you.<<else>>"Oh." Kylar pulls the chair away, then glances back. "I'll just be here." <<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>> puts the headphones on without starting anything.<</if>>
          <br><br>
          You listen to the computer fan. When you turn towards the window, Kylar turns too. The dark reflection contains both of you.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你想独自在床边坐几分钟。
          <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').reaction is 'guarded'>>“你要去见谁？”你还没回答，凯拉尔就站起来。你指向床。“这里。我说的是这里。”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>仍挡在你和房门之间。直到你坐下，<<nnpc_he 'Kylar'>>才退回椅子旁，椅子仍朝着你。<<else>>“哦。”凯拉尔把椅子拉远，又回过头。“我就在这里。”<<nnpc_He 'Kylar'>>戴上耳机，却没有点开什么东西。<</if>>
          <br><br>
          你听着电脑风扇。转向窗户时，凯拉尔也转过头。暗下去的倒影里有你们两个人。
      <</language>><br><br>
  <</switch>>
<<else>>
  <<language>><<option 'EN'>>The room is quiet. You leave the conversation for a time when Kylar is here and awake.<<option 'CN'>>房间很安静。你把这段话留到凯拉尔在这里，也醒着的时候再说。<</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '回到房间'] 'Manor Kylar Room'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Lost Lamb Sydney Talk
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if $passage isnot 'Lost Lamb Sydney Talk'>><<exit>><</if>>
<<if $nextPassageCheck or $nextPassage>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] `$nextPassageCheck || $nextPassage`>><</lanLink>><br><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('LostLamb') or !$LostLamb?.sydneyTalk>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return', '返回'] 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Sydney>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You tap your knuckles against the wooden surface: two quiet taps, a brief pause, then one final tap.
    <br><br>
    Sydney's hand freezes mid-movement. A book slides an inch across the surface before resting against <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> wrist. <<nnpc_He 'Sydney'>> slowly lifts <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> head, staring at your fingers, <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> eyes wide with disbelief and an ache long buried.
    <br><br>
    "That rhythm..." <<nnpc_His 'Sydney'>> voice is barely more than a whisper. "Where did you... That was our secret knock. Outside the garden door. Before the church told me I was never allowed to visit that house again."
    <br><br>
    <<nnpc_He 'Sydney'>> looks into your eyes, a tremor in <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> breath.
    <br><br>
    "You've been there, haven't you? In that manor. Kylar... is Kylar still in that big, quiet house all alone?"
    <br><br>
    You tell Sydney that you visit Kylar often, and that you stay there together now.
    <br><br>
    Sydney lets out a long, trembling breath, as though setting down a weight carried since childhood.
    <br><br>
    "I was so young when they told me not to go back. They said the house was dangerous, that darkness had settled in... but I always remembered leaving the drawings behind. I'm so glad... so glad Kylar isn't alone anymore."
    <br><br>
    <<nnpc_He 'Sydney'>> reaches out and gently covers your hand with <<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>> own, giving you a warm, grateful look.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你的指节在木质桌面上轻轻叩响：两声轻叩，短暂的停顿，接着是一声利落的收尾。
    <br><br>
    悉尼手中的动作瞬间僵住了。书页在手腕旁滑开一寸，无声地停下。<<nnpc_He 'Sydney'>>缓缓抬起头，睁大眼睛注视着你的手指，神情里翻涌着难以置信的震动，以及埋藏已久的恍惚与酸楚。
    <br><br>
    “那个节律……”<<nnpc_his 'Sydney'>>的声音轻得几乎听不清，“你是在哪里……那是我们以前的暗号。在花园后门的木阶上。在神殿严厉告诫我绝不能再去那所房子之前。”
    <br><br>
    <<nnpc_He 'Sydney'>>怔怔地看着你的眼睛，呼吸带着一丝微颤。
    <br><br>
    “你去过那里，对不对？那座庄园。凯拉尔……凯拉尔还在那座又大又安静的房子里吗？一直一个人？”
    <br><br>
    你告诉悉尼，你经常去庄园看望凯拉尔，你们如今就在那里相伴。
    <br><br>
    悉尼长长地呼出一口气，肩膀微微松弛下来，仿佛卸下了从孩童时起就一直悬在心头的一块重石。
    <br><br>
    “当年他们叫我别再去时，我年纪还太小。他们说那所房子很危险，有什么不祥的东西落在了那里……可我总记挂着留在桌上的画纸。我真的很庆幸……庆幸凯拉尔身边终于有人陪伴了。”
    <br><br>
    <<nnpc_He 'Sydney'>>伸出手，轻轻覆在你的手背上，眼中满是温和与感激。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Step back', '退回'] `$LostLamb_sydneyReturn || 'Temple Sydney'`>><<unset $LostLamb_sydneyReturn>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Lost Lamb Gwylan Talk
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if $passage isnot 'Lost Lamb Gwylan Talk'>><<exit>><</if>>
<<if $nextPassageCheck or $nextPassage>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] `$nextPassageCheck || $nextPassage`>><</lanLink>><br><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('LostLamb') or !$LostLamb?.gwylanTalk>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the shop', '返回店内'] 'Forest Shop Entrance'>><</lanLink>><br><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Gwylan>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Gwylan pauses what <<he>> is doing with the bundle of dried herbs. <<He>> looks past you into the mist of the forest for a quiet moment.
    <br><br>
    "Travellers?" <<he>> murmurs, the kettle boiling softly on the iron grate behind <<him>>. "I haven't forgotten them. It was years ago... two adults, their fine clothes torn and smeared with peat. They were crawling through the undergrowth, their eyes glassy and distant."
    <br><br>
    Gwylan pours steaming, golden liquid into two earthenware cups, pushing one toward you. The gentle fragrance of sweet leaf and honey immediately cuts through the chill.
    <br><br>
    "They were murmuring a child's name... Kylar, wasn't it? Begging whatever was shadowing them in the dark to look away from their home. Whatever had laid hold of them was far beyond anything my teas or poultices could draw out. By morning, they were gone deeper into the mire."
    <br><br>
    <<He>> sighs, a quiet sympathy softening <<his>> worn features.
    <br><br>
    "I heard a child was left behind in that old house on the outskirts. All alone with the shadows and the locked doors. I often wondered if anyone would ever help that child find their way out." Gwylan watches you wrap your fingers around the warm cup. "Drink up, little one. You carry too many heavy memories for such young shoulders."
    <br><br>
    You drink the warm tea. A deep, settling calm spreads through your chest.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    格威岚停下了手中正在整理的干草束。<<He>>转过头，透过薄雾望向森林深处，安静了片刻。
    <br><br>
    “行路人？”<<he>>低声自语，身后的铁炉上水壶正微微冒着白汽。“我没有忘记他们。那已经是多年前的事了……两个成年人，体面的衣裳被撕扯得破烂不堪，沾满了泥炭。他们在灌木丛里艰难地爬行，眼神空洞而涣散。”
    <br><br>
    格威岚把热气腾腾的金黄色茶水斟进两只陶杯里，将其中一只推到你面前。甘叶与野蜜的清香立刻驱散了林间的阴寒。
    <br><br>
    “他们嘴里一直在念叨一个孩子的名字……凯拉尔，对吧？他们哀求着黑暗里跟在他们身后的东西，求它别靠近他们的宅邸。缠上他们的东西，根本不是我的草药和药膏所能化解的。到了天亮，他们就彻底陷进了更深的沼泽荒野里。”
    <br><br>
    <<He>>轻轻叹了口气，沧桑的面容上流露出一丝温和的同情。
    <br><br>
    “后来我听说，镇郊那栋老房子里留下了一个孩子。一个人守着满屋的阴影和紧闭的门锁。我有时也会想，会不会有人能帮那个孩子找到走出来的路。”格威岚看着你双手捧住温热的茶杯。“喝吧，孩子。你这副年轻的肩膀上，背了太多沉重的旧事。”
    <br><br>
    你喝下温热的草药茶，一股踏实的温热缓缓在胸口化开。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the shop', '返回店内'] 'Forest Shop Entrance'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Lost Lamb Bishop Talk
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if $passage isnot 'Lost Lamb Bishop Talk'>><<exit>><</if>>
<<if $nextPassageCheck or $nextPassage>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Continue', '继续'] `$nextPassageCheck || $nextPassage`>><</lanLink>><br><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('LostLamb') or !$LostLamb?.bishopTalk>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<loadNPC 0 'bishop'>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Under the heavy cowl of the dark habit, the bishop's pale face tilts slightly toward you. A faint, knowing smile touches <<his>> lips, neither surprised nor perturbed by your question.
    <br><br>
    "The sealed house," <<he>> drawls in that low, measured cadence. "And the locks that were gnawed. So you've heard the echoes after all, child. Or perhaps you walked those very floorboards in a dream."
    <br><br>
    <<He>> laces <<his>> fingers together inside the wide sleeves, the silver wire coiled at <<his>> wrists giving a soft, metallic clink.
    <br><br>
    "Their parents invited something into their parlor that they could not put back into the bottle. They made a bargain under the red moon. When the corruption began to fester and gnaw at the very joists, they dropped to their knees before us and pleaded for their child to be spared."
    <br><br>
    The bishop's smile fades into a cold, flat pragmatism.
    <br><br>
    "We sealed the doors. We hammered iron nails through the frames and barred the cellar. We contained the infection where it stood so Jordan and <<nnpc_his 'Jordan'>> soft-hearted flock could sleep in peaceful ignorance. The child was left alive and fed. That was the bargain. That was our mercy."
    <br><br>
    <<He>> leans forward slightly, the shadow beneath the hood obscuring <<his>> eyes.
    <br><br>
    "The world is full of holes, child, and not all of them can be mended with prayers and honey. Do not pry at the seams of that house. Some locks were gnawed away for a reason, and you would do well to leave the dead where they were laid."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    深色长袍宽大的兜帽下，主教苍白的面孔微微转向你。<<His>>唇角掠过一丝了然的浅笑，对你的发问既不意外，也无慌乱。
    <br><br>
    “那所封死的房子，”<<he>>用那种低沉、从容的调子慢吞吞地说道，“还有那些被啃咬过的锁。看来你终究还是听到了那些回响，孩子。又或者，你是在梦里亲自走过了那段地板。”
    <br><br>
    <<He>>在宽大的袖管内十指相扣，手腕处缠绕的细银丝发出一阵极轻微的金属摩擦声。
    <br><br>
    “那对父母把不该招惹的东西引进了客厅，却再也没法把它收回去。他们在红月下达成了交易。当秽物开始溃烂、甚至啃咬房屋的大梁时，他们跪倒在我们面前，苦苦哀求放过他们的孩子。”
    <br><br>
    主教嘴角的笑意褪去，化作一种冰冷、务实的决断。
    <br><br>
    “我们封死了所有的门。我们用铁钉钉死了窗框，锁住了地窖。我们把秽病截断在它原本的位置，这样约旦和<<nnpc_his 'Jordan'>>那些心慈手软的信众才能在无知中安眠。那个孩子活了下来，也从未挨饿。这就是当时的交易，也是我们的仁慈。”
    <br><br>
    <<He>>微微前倾身子，兜帽的深暗阴影完全遮住了<<his>>双眼。
    <br><br>
    “这世上多的是漏洞，孩子，但绝非每一个洞都能靠祈祷和蜜糖来填补。别去撬动那座房子的缝隙。有些锁被啃咬掉自有它的道理，你最好让死者留在他们安歇的地方。”
<</language>>
